{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"Three recommendations need correction: hoisted dependencies make import failure timing observable; `try-require` alone cannot make an already-failed eager link catchable; and published safepoint sites need a pinned retrieval and verification contract. I’m also separating stable code-root identity from manifest identity, which still changes when dependency pins change.\n"}}
